| Cursor Configuration (using npx) | Free-installation | [COMPATIBLE METHOD but PLATFORM INCOMPATIBLE] |

### 1.3 Alternative Deployment Plan

Even if I were to design a local deployment plan, it would still fail because:
- The server requires iTerm2 AppleScript/automation APIs
- These APIs only exist on macOS
- Linux has no equivalent to iTerm2

